<http://data.silknow.org/object/4fe66379-4942-3ecc-8ac9-12903ccf32ad/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "White satin: worked with silk and metal threads and purl (spiral wire, some of it silk-covered). Design: Flora seated on grassy bank with pot of flowers on her knee and flowers in each hand, surrounded by flowers, birds and animals, worked in satin stitch and lace stitches in greens, blues, and yellows, with a small quantity of red. The underside of cushion is covered with green damask with conventionalized leaf pattern."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/4fe66379-4942-3ecc-8ac9-12903ccf32ad> .

